**Root cause:** Every test follows a "call it and pray" pattern — they exercise code paths for coverage tools but verify nothing about correctness. This is why bugs escape to production despite 95% line coverage. The fix is to add **value-level assertions** (`AreEqual`) on every test's expected outcome and add negative-path tests for error contracts.
